// The sun just behind the edge of a tower: the layer of `cumulus_contre_jour` (same seed),
// the sun turned 24° in azimuth and the camera 12° towards it, so that the sun sits just
// above the crest. Checks the bright rim that forward scattering lights along the edges
// near the sun, which the composition of `cumulus_contre_jour` (sun 6 to 10° from the
// edges) does not show (art director's review of 2026-11-09): without this scene, a
// regression of the rim would go unnoticed. The very clear day of `cumulus_contre_jour`.
Scene(
    description: "Le soleil juste derrière le bord d'une tour de cumulus, vu de la poursuite dans la couche de `cumulus_contre_jour` : un liseré clair le long de la crête près du soleil, qui s'éteint loin de lui ; doré plutôt qu'argenté, le soleil n'étant qu'à 9°.",
    scenario: "vol-2000",
    camera: Chase(yaw: Deg(78.0), pitch: Deg(5.0)),
    sun: Some((azimuth: Deg(156.0), elevation: Deg(9.0))),
    clouds: Some((base: M(1500.0), cover: 0.45, cloud_type: 1.0, thickness: Some(M(1200.0)), seed: 20)),
    visibility: Some(Km(50.0)),
)
